or-widget-image\" data-id=\"bcecbb9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-\u8be6\u60c58.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2384\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-\u8be6\u60c58.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-\u8be6\u60c58-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-\u8be6\u60c58-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2563217 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2563217\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-02-\u8be6\u60c59.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2385\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-02-\u8be6\u60c59.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-02-\u8be6\u60c59-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-02-\u8be6\u60c59-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a6c0d67 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a6c0d67\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Use and Maintenance<\/h3><ul><li>In order to ensure its efficient operation and extend its service life, acrylic filter bags need to be maintained and cleaned regularly.<\/li><li>Check the appearance of the filter bag regularly to see if there is any damage, wear or holes. If any damage is found in the filter bag, it should be replaced in time.<\/li><li>The filter bag should be stored in a dry place to avoid mold growth, and avoid direct sunlight to prevent aging of the acrylic material.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Philite\u00ae manufactures high performance homopolymer acrylic filter bags and provides reliable filtration solutions. Customized sizes are available In addition to the standard sizes.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Material<\/strong>\u00a0: 100% Acrylic staple fiber.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Scrim<\/strong>: With Acrylic staple yarn.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Length &amp; diameter<\/strong>: No limited.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Weight<\/strong>: 300 -600g\/m2 \u00b110%.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Temperature (\u2103\/\u2109)<\/strong>: Continue: 120\/248, Instant: 140\/284.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Finish-treatment<\/strong>: Calendering, Heat setting, Singeing.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Anti-acid and alkali<\/strong>: PH ranges from 3-11.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Filtration Efficiency<\/strong>: Reach to 99.5%.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Stable working time<\/strong>: Up to more than 3000 hours. Could be used cyclically.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2372,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"full-width-container","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"de